# What the safetensors runtime needs, compiled into a pinned lockfile per hardware variant.
# The application installs from the lockfile and never resolves live.
#
# transformers[serving] brings FastAPI and Uvicorn, which is the OpenAI compatible server
# itself. requests is listed explicitly because the transformers CLI imports it at module
# scope and the serving extra does not pull it in, so the command line fails to load without it.
transformers[serving]==5.15.1
requests
accelerate
torch
